        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Death Flash"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(light)\n\nWhen the caligni creeper dies, their body combusts in a flash of bright light. All creatures in a 10-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 17 Fortitude save or be blinded for 1d6 rounds. Creatures with light blindness who successfully save are still blinded for 1 round. The creeper's gear and treasure are left in a pile where they died. As this isn't a magical effect, the light has no effect within magical darkness."
            },
            "id": "6fab3575-d4b2-4fa2-9f01-88c15f586beb",
